# ---- Local write-test / ephemeral output ----
# (covered above under root-level scratch)
#
# NOTE: do not add a trailing `.env*` or a second `.vercel` here. A later pattern overrides
# the `!.env.example` / `!.env.*.template` negations above and would hide the committed
# templates from git. `.vercel` is already ignored in the Vercel section.
